ersion control history into formal technical documentation as defined by Recital 71. It bridges the gap between raw code and regulatory prose.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will build a tool that parses git commits, model cards, and dataset manifests to generate living compliance documents in real time. The pipeline will automatically flag missing documentation fields.\",\n      \"why\": \"It ensures our intellectual merit is clearly articulated for regulators without diverting scientists from their primary research.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
