ntation Pipeline\",\n      \"what\": \"A standardized pipeline that automatically generates the technical documentation described in Recital 71 using training scripts and dataset manifests. This creates a living record of the system's evolution.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will implement a template-driven system that extracts metadata from our existing experiment tracking tools to populate required EU AI Act fields. This replaces manual report writing with a documentation-as-code approach.\",\n      \"why\": \"It ensures consistent compliance across diverse research teams and accelerates the path to deployment.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
