g sinks and audit trails during the initial environment setup. These templates provide a 'plug-and-play' architecture for record-keeping.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will develop a proprietary Python library containing pre-built logging handlers tailored specifically to the EU AI Act's high-risk categories for immediate import into new projects.\",\n      \"why\": \"It ensures technical viability from day one, preventing costly architectural refactors when moving prototypes toward production.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
