ng costly architectural refactors when moving from prototype to production.\n\n    *   Role check: Dev Engineer? Yes.\n    *   Concern: Technical viability/speed/quality of prototyping? Yes.\n    *   Reasoning 3-5 sentences? Yes.\n    *   Stance score 0-100? Yes.\n    *   Exactly 3 distinct proposals? Yes.\n    *   Title (max 10 words)? Yes.\n    *   What (1-2 sentences), How (1-2 sentences), Why (1 sentence)? Yes.\n    *   Length per proposal: 60-110 words? Let's check.\n        *   Prop 1: ~75 words. Good.\n        *   Prop 2: ~70 words. Good.\n        *   Prop 3: ~70 words. Good.\n    *   Plain prose (no bullet lists inside)? Yes.",
