oughout the lifetime of the AI system as mandated by Recital 71.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI Provenance and Auditability Research Project\",\n      \"what\": \"A dedicated R&D initiative to develop advanced techniques for mapping specific outputs back to their training data and input parameters. This focuses on the 'traceability' requirement of the Act.\",\n      \"how\": \"The research team will explore provenance tracking and graph-based metadata storage to create a searchable map between inputs, reference databases, and results. They will prototype tools that can automatically generate compliance reports for regulators.\",\n      \"why\": \"This transforms a regulatory obligation into a market-leading technical advantage in system transparency.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
