ility Research Initiative\",\n      \"what\": \"A dedicated research project to develop low-overhead methods for recording high-dimensional model states without impacting latency. It treats regulatory logging as a technical optimization challenge.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will assign a small cross-functional team to investigate compressed logging formats and selective event sampling techniques that maintain legal traceability. This work will be integrated into our core infrastructure updates.\",\n      \"why\": \"This converts a compliance constraint into a scientific opportunity for high-impact publications and improved system efficiency.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
