n    {\n      \"title\": \"Automated Technical Documentation Generator Research\",\n      \"what\": \"A small internal project to develop AI tools that automatically extract and format technical documentation from code, commit messages, and experiment logs. This treats the regulatory requirement as a research challenge.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will assign a small team of engineers to build LLM-based agents that can map R&D artifacts directly to the specific requirements of the EU AI Act. The tool will be tested on one pilot project first.\",\n      \"why\": \"This turns a tedious regulatory burden into a scientific opportunity to innovate in the field of automated software documentation.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
