er a specific decision can be fully reconstructed.\",\n      \"how\": \"The compliance team will conduct 'traceability drills' where they pick a random system output and require engineers to retrieve the corresponding logs and human verification IDs. Any gaps found will trigger an immediate redesign of that project's recording capabilities.\",\n      \"why\": \"This proactively mitigates the risk of massive fines by identifying compliance failures before they reach external regulators.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
