  {\n      \"title\": \"Automated Data Lineage and Provenance Pipeline\",\n      \"what\": \"A system for the automated tracking of all training, testing, and validation datasets used in high-risk model versions. This creates a transparent map from raw data to final weights.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will implement a version-controlled data lake using cryptographic hashing to create an immutable audit trail of every dataset iteration. Integration with our experiment trackers will automate the documentation process.\",\n      \"why\": \"It satisfies the technical documentation requirements of Recital 71 while significantly improving research reproducibility.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
