ogging techniques for large-scale AI systems. This explores how to maintain legality without exhausting our storage infrastructure.\",\n      \"how\": \"The team will explore sketching algorithms and differential privacy to minimize the data footprint of required event logs while maintaining auditability.\",\n      \"why\": \"It turns a regulatory burden into a scientific opportunity to lead in efficient AI governance technology.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
