rch\",\n      \"what\": \"A specialized R&D project to develop logging methods that maintain regulatory traceability without storing sensitive personal data in plain text. This addresses the tension between Article 12 and GDPR.\",\n      \"how\": \"The lab will investigate cryptographic hashing and secure multi-party computation to verify log integrity without compromising privacy. We will prototype these tools on our existing high-risk models.\",\n      \"why\": \"This transforms a compliance burden into a proprietary technological advantage and enhances our market reputation.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
