d-keeping by researchers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Human-in-the-Loop Audit Interface\",\n      \"what\": \"A lightweight web portal designed specifically for experts to review and electronically sign off on AI search matches. This tool handles the identification of natural persons involved in verification.\",\n      \"how\": \"The interface will pull flagged logs from our middleware and provide a simple 'approve/reject' workflow linked to institutional SSO identities. Every action will be timestamped and written to an immutable audit log.\",\n      \"why\": \"This transforms a complex regulatory mandate into a streamlined technical workflow for human-AI collaboration.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
