der the high-risk categories specified in the Act. This defines our actual scope of work.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will convene a cross-functional panel consisting of legal experts and lead scientists to map existing project goals against Annex III criteria. They will produce a mandatory classification registry.\",\n      \"why\": \"Precise classification ensures we only allocate expensive logging resources to systems that are legally required to have them.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
