ogs for patterns indicating substantial modifications or operational risks. This transforms passive record-keeping into an active safety monitoring system.\",\n      \"how\": \"The data science team will develop anomaly detection algorithms that trigger alerts when log data suggests a breach of predefined safety parameters. These tools will run continuously against live system logs.\",\n      \"why\": \"This proactively addresses the mandate in Article 12(2)(a) to identify situations resulting in systemic risk.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
