{\n      \"title\": \"Dynamic Risk-Detection Benchmarking Suite\",\n      \"what\": \"A research initiative to develop automated probes that detect when a system's behavior drifts toward the risk thresholds defined in Article 12(2). This turns compliance monitoring into a scientific study of model stability.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will build a suite of synthetic edge-case generators and monitoring agents that trigger specific logs whenever safety boundaries are approached. These probes will be integrated directly into our post-market monitoring pipeline.\",\n      \"why\": \"This pushes the knowledge frontier of AI safety while providing the precise evidence needed for regulatory auditing.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
