 },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Automated Technical Documentation Pipeline\",\n      \"what\": \"This is a tool that dynamically generates EU-compliant technical documentation directly from training logs, hyperparameters, and code commits. It automates the creation of records described in Recital 71.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will integrate MLflow metadata with a customized template engine to produce real-time reports on system capabilities, limitations, and validation processes. This pipeline will trigger an update every time a model version is tagged for deployment.\",\n      \"why\": \"It drastically reduces the administrative burden on researchers while guaranteeing that documentation remains current throughout the system lifetime.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
