ance and Traceability Scientific Initiative\",\n      \"what\": \"A dedicated research project to develop novel methods for efficient, tamper-proof data provenance in large-scale AI systems. This shifts our focus from passive logging to active, verifiable traceability of model decisions.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will allocate a small team of researchers to explore cryptographic hashing for event logs. They will integrate these prototypes into our most ambitious high-risk projects to test viability and performance.\",\n      \"why\": \"It transforms a compliance burden into a publishable scientific contribution that enhances the lab's prestige.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
