ition from prototype to product.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Risk-Aware Project Lifecycle Trigger\",\n      \"what\": \"A technical triage system integrated into our CI/CD pipeline that classifies projects by risk level and automatically enables specific logging modules. It ensures that only high-risk systems bear the overhead of full traceability.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will implement an onboarding checklist in the deployment pipeline that triggers the mandatory instantiation of Article 12-compliant infrastructure if a project is flagged as high-risk. This prevents over-engineering on low-stakes research.\",\n      \"why\": \"It optimizes resource allocation by applying strict regulatory constraints only where they are legally required.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
