ine which R&D projects fall under the high-risk classification of Annex III. This ensures we apply Article 12 requirements only where legally mandated.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will establish a quarterly review board consisting of legal counsel and principal investigators. They will use a standardized rubric based on the AI Act's risk criteria to flag systems requiring enhanced logging.\",\n      \"why\": \"This protects lab resources from being wasted on unnecessary compliance overhead for low-risk research projects.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
