        "content": "{\n  \"reasoning\": \"We should treat these record-keeping mandates as foundational infrastructure rather than a distraction from our core scientific goals. By integrating automated logging and traceability into our standard development lifecycle, we ensure that our high-risk innovations remain deployable and compliant within the EU. This allows us to maintain our focus on intellectual merit while satisfying the regulatory demand for transparency.\",\n  \"stance\": 15,\n  \"proposals\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Automated Compliance Logging Framework\",\n      \"what\": \"A standardized software library that automatically captures event timestamps, input data, and system state transitions across all high-risk projects.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will integrate a middleware layer into our model serving infrastructure to log telemetry without requiring manual researcher intervention.\",\n      \"why\": \"It reduces the administrative burden on scientists while ensuring rigorous adherence to Article 12.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Interpretability-Driven Traceability Research\",\n      \"what\": \"A research project aimed at linking high-level event logs to internal model activations for deeper forensic analysis of AI failures.\",\n      \"how\": \"The team will develop new methods to map automated log entries to specific latent representations in neural networks during risk events.\",\n      \"why\": \"This advances the scientific understanding of system failure modes while satisfying regulatory traceability requirements.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Dynamic Technical Documentation Pipeline\",\n      \"what\": \"A version-controlled documentation system that automatically syncs model hyperparameters and training data lineage with required regulatory dossiers.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will implement an automated pipeline using experiment tracking tools to generate compliance reports in real time during the R&D process.\",\n      \"why\": \"This ensures our technical documentation remains current throughout the lifetime of the AI system as mandated by Recital 71.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
