ex III Systems\",\n      \"what\": \"A specialized logging layer designed specifically for identity-matching systems to track database references and human verification events. It targets the most stringent requirements of Article 12(3).\",\n      \"how\": \"We will implement a secure, immutable ledger that maps every match event to the specific reference dataset version and the verifying operator's ID. This requires updating our data access layer.\",\n      \"why\": \"This directly mitigates the high legal risks and potential fines associated with biometric AI deployment in the EU.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
