ceability Metrics for Scientific AI\",\n      \"what\": \"A collaborative effort to define what constitutes appropriate traceability for different classes of scientific AI. This project aims to codify the technical meaning of meaningful event recording.\",\n      \"how\": \"The lab will author a series of white papers and engage with EU regulatory bodies to propose specific, domain-aware logging standards that balance transparency with research agility. We will lead the consensus building process.\",\n      \"why\": \"Establishing these standards ensures our institution helps shape the regulatory landscape rather than just reacting to it.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
