ineering.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will sunset three low-impact legacy projects to redirect those specific funding streams toward building the traceability frameworks required by the Act.\",\n      \"why\": \"It ensures that essential compliance work does not cannibalize the budgets of our most ambitious and high-risk scientific pursuits.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
